    "overview": "Xerxes is a Bun/Electron desktop for working with developer agents. The approved direction is macOS-inspired glass: translucent navigation, softly highlighted controls, and an opaque reading surface within a compact continuous workspace. The serif XERXES wordmark remains the signature.\n\nThis material refinement supersedes the earlier no-glass direction. It uses Electron native vibrancy and CSS translucent materials; it does not implement Apple’s SwiftUI Liquid Glass refraction API.",
